    "系统触发角已把%@用于「%@」，两者会同时触发。可换一个角，或在系统设置 → 桌面与程序坞 → 触发角里把该角设为「-」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS already uses the %@ hot corner for “%@”, so both will fire. Pick another corner, or set that corner to “-” in System Settings → Desktop & Dock → Hot Corners."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统触发角已把%@用于「%@」，两者会同时触发。可换一个角，或在系统设置 → 桌面与程序坞 → 触发角里把该角设为「-」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
