      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads the app order and folders from the native Launchpad (read-only; Launchpad data is not changed) and applies them to the Home screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取原生启动台的应用顺序和文件夹（只读，不修改启动台数据）并应用到主屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未找到本机的启动台数据库。请选择一份启动台数据库文件（通常名为 db）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Launchpad database was found on this Mac. Choose a Launchpad database file (usually named “db”)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到本机的启动台数据库。请选择一份启动台数据库文件（通常名为 db）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从启动台导入布局？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import layout from Launchpad?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从启动台导入布局？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将按原生启动台的顺序和文件夹重排主屏幕，启动台里没有的应用排在后面；只读取，不修改启动台数据。导入前会自动备份，可用「恢复上次备份」撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Home screen will be rearranged to match the native Launchpad order and folders; apps not in Launchpad go at the end. Launchpad data is only read, never changed. A backup is made automatically first — use “Restore Last Backup” to undo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将按原生启动台的顺序和文件夹重排主屏幕，启动台里没有的应用排在后面；只读取，不修改启动台数据。导入前会自动备份，可用「恢复上次备份」撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
