    "左键切换启动器，右键打开菜单，按住 Option 再左键打开设置。关闭后仍可用快捷键呼出；从启动器顶部设置按钮或按 Command-逗号可再次打开设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left-click toggles the launcher, right-click opens the menu, Option-click opens Settings. When off, the keyboard shortcut still works; reopen Settings from the launcher gear or press Command-Comma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左键切换启动器，右键打开菜单，按住 Option 再左键打开设置。关闭后仍可用快捷键呼出；从启动器顶部设置按钮或按 Command-逗号可再次打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    }
